    {
      "id": "c13",
      "chapter": "Ch3 Count: why it worked",
      "file": "vo/ep3/c13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 29.8,
      "leadFrames": 6,
      "frames": 912,
      "startFrame": 7587,
      "narration": "Here's why. <short pause> Giving a box early is really a pass. You take the box, then you have to draw. <short pause> So you draw the last safe line. He's stuck. <short pause> He hands you the short chain, on purpose. <short pause> And you're the one who opens the long one. <short pause> Play safe there, and he only wins five–four. <short pause> Give the box, and it's six–three. <short pause> One box, given early. He finishes three ahead.",
      "estimated": true,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Here's why.",
          "start": 0.15,
          "end": 1.118
        },
        {
          "text": "Giving a box early is really a pass.",
          "start": 1.118,
          "end": 4.287
        },
        {
          "text": "You take the box, then you have to draw.",
          "start": 4.287,
          "end": 7.808
        },
        {
          "text": "So you draw the last safe line.",
          "start": 7.808,
          "end": 10.537
        },
        {
          "text": "He's stuck.",
          "start": 10.537,
          "end": 11.505
        },
        {
          "text": "He hands you the short chain, on purpose.",
          "start": 11.505,
          "end": 15.114
        },
        {
          "text": "And you're the one who opens the long one.",
          "start": 15.114,
          "end": 18.811
        },
